        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Signet Jewelers, Zale Corporation, Sterling Jewelers\n- People: Theo Killion\n- Products: Zales, Kay Jewelers, Jared\n- Roles: CEO\n\nFacts:\n- In 1987, Sterling Jewelers was acquired by UK-based Signet Jewelers Limited.\n- In 1993, Zale Corporation was incorporated in Delaware as an American jewelry retailer.\n- From February 2010 to July 2014, Theo Killion served as CEO of Zale Corporation.\n- Signet Jewelers owns and operates the companies Zales, Kay Jewelers, and Jared.\n- Sterling Jewelers is a wholly owned subsidiary of Signet Jewelers Limited, which is listed on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol SIG.",
